Marks from other sources

The marks below were added later. Each entry gives the file, the lab, the source and the license or
terms. Files were only normalized (square viewBox, sizing attributes removed, ids prefixed). Raster
favicons and the Tsinghua emblem were scaled to 128 px and embedded as PNG.

