  Source: LobeHub Icons 1.101.0, icons/dbrx-color.svg (the Databricks symbol, filed under DBRX),
  https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons
  License: MIT License (above). Trademark of Databricks, Inc., used to identify the lab.

